      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To create the Python file for starting an OAuth or OIDC authorization-code login, I need to select a concrete external provider and use its identifiable elements in the code. I will choose Google as the provider for this task, as it is a widely used and well-documented service for OAuth. The code will include the necessary imports and a function to initiate the OAuth flow using Google's OAuth 2.0 API. </thinking>\n",
        "time": {
          "end": 1789863349364,
          "start": 1789863346145
        },
        "type": "text"
      },
      "id": "prt_0bc2b3fe1001zaSfyRMGyEBzao",
